        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R2002, Traditional R-Series 18\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis R-Series Towel Bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known. The traditional styling of the mounts on Deltana's R2002 towel bar makes it great for any traditional setting; and the 18 inch length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made out of solid brass, it is available in beautiful finishes. Truly versatile, this 18 inch towel bar is perfect for the bathroom or the kitchen to hold both bath-towels and hand-towels alike.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2002.gif?v=1704354623\" width=\"600\" height=\"202\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R2002 18\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-24-inch-towel-bar-deltana-r2003\"><b>24\" R-Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-30-inch-towel-bar-deltana-r2004\"><b>30\" R-Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the R Solid Brass 18\" Classic Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length center to center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 20-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2002.pdf?v=1704262289\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R2002 18\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
